10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[296] KEEP      start=1207.36 end=1211.32 nsp=0.3704  text='А-а-а-а-а!'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[297] KEEP      start=1241.32 end=1243.32 nsp=0.5537  text='Не дам!'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[298] KEEP      start=1271.32 end=1274.32 nsp=0.4412  text='Убасая, да, да, да, да.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[299] KEEP      start=1277.32 end=1279.32 nsp=0.4412  text='Уборилок у нас, да, да.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[300] KEEP [?] start=1289.32 end=1290.32 nsp=0.4412 music=1 DISPUTE  text='А, да, да, да, да.'
