10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[301] KEEP      start=1301.32 end=1306.90 nsp=0.3002  text='Угу, мужа.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[302] KEEP      start=1317.40 end=1319.02 nsp=0.3002  text='Сошла за кончей вижу.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[303] KEEP      start=1319.54 end=1320.98 nsp=0.3002  text='Давай, векочек.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[304] KEEP      start=1320.98 end=1322.38 nsp=0.3002  text='Пожалуйста, кончe.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[305] KEEP      start=1322.38 end=1324.08 nsp=0.3002  text='Угу, угу, угу.'
10:48:16.512 [transcriber] seg[306] DROP L2   start=1324.08 end=1326.08 nsp=0.3002  text='Угу, угу, угу, угу.'
